<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of rain-affected English</p>
<p>Sunday League matches:</p>
<p>At Worcester: Worcestershire beat Lancashire by 114 runs.</p>
<p>Worcestershire 235-7 innings closed (G.Hick 86, V.Solanki 58),</p>
<p>Lancashire 121.</p>
<p>At Southend: Essex beat Derbyshire by one run. Essex 205-7</p>
<p>innings closed R.Irani 52), Derbyshire 121-7 innings closed.</p>
<p>At Swansea: Glamorgan beat Sussex by 8 wickets. Sussex 135</p>
<p>(W.Athey 60; Waqar Younis 4-14), Glamorgan 136-2 (H.Morris 66</p>
<p>not out).</p>
<p>At Leicester: Warwickshire beat Leicestershire by 8 wickets</p>
<p>in a match reduced to 15 overs. Leicestershire 115-8 innings</p>
<p>closed, Warwickshire 117-2.</p>
<p>At Headingley (Leeds): Yorkshire beat Middlesex by 6</p>
<p>wickets. Middlesex 173-8 innings closed (J.Pooley 61, P.Weekes</p>
<p>53 not out), Yorkshire 175-4.</p>
<p>At Luton: Northamptonshire v Gloucestershire - match</p>
<p>abandoned.</p>
</text>
